+# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
+# csv format
+# TIMESTAMP	ContextTokens	GeneratedTokens
+# 2024-05-10 00:00:00.009930+00:00	2162	5
+
+# Get distribution of ContextTokens and GeneratedTokens from entire dataset
+
